      "disable": "<p>@Check[type:thievery|dc:12] to remove the trapdoor</p>",
      "description": "The sofa is part of a hidden pit trap. Anyone coming within 5 feet of the sofa is in danger of falling through a hole in the floor into a chute lined with sharpened stakes coated in spider venom. The sofa itself is affixed to the floor via several sturdy timbers. It does not follow falling victims into area A14 below.",
